abstract: An agent-based framework to simulate the diffusion process of a piece of
  misinformation according to the SBFC model in which the fake news and its debunking
  compete in a social network. Considering new classes of agents, this model is closer
  to reality and proposed different strategies how to mitigate and control misinformation.
